    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chill and wait (poll pattern)\nSet Target -> Start -> loop: Check At Target -> IF at_target -> done; else Wait 30 s and check again.\n\nIteration cap: Below Iteration Cap? uses $runIndex (0-based) < 39, so at most 40 checks (about 20 minutes). When the cap is reached, the slot is stopped and the execution fails.\n\nDo not enable Continue On Fail on the stop node unless an IF node right after it checks json.error. See the node README.\n\nSelect your own Inheco TEC credential on every Inheco TEC node.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
